Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is serrated ribbon seagrass, Cymodocea\Nserrulata.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.01,0:00:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is a display, not a scan of a meadow in Mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,The leaf is a flat strap, wider than smooth\Nribbon seagrass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Run your eye to the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The edge is serrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sheath is broadly triangular.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.01,0:00:23.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then look at the stem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The leaf scars do not form a closed ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That open scar line is how you separate this\Nplant from smooth ribbon seagrass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The patch spreads as the buried stem grows\Nthrough the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:40.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Roots grow down at each node.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can also flower and set seed.
